{"id":"6e45f12c389981a1","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/718_ALC.md","title":"718 ALC","display":"718_ALC","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"718-ALC\">718 ALC</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)\">\\(\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_C\">\\(N_C\\)</span> 为概念名集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_R\">\\(N_R\\)</span> 为角色名集合，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_C\\cap N_R=\\varnothing\">\\(N_C\\cap N_R=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>ALC 的概念构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{name}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}:\nN_R\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}:\nN_R\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号（概念位置的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{name}(A)\\)</span>）：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=\\operatorname{top},\\quad\\bot=\\operatorname{bottom},\\quad\\neg C=\\operatorname{neg}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=\\operatorname{top},\\quad\\bot=\\operatorname{bottom},\\quad\\neg C=\\operatorname{neg}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C\\sqcap D=\\operatorname{conj}(C,D),\\quad C\\sqcup D=\\operatorname{disj}(C,D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C\\sqcap D=\\operatorname{conj}(C,D),\\quad C\\sqcup D=\\operatorname{disj}(C,D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall R.C=\\operatorname{forall}(R,C),\\quad\\exists R.C=\\operatorname{exists}(R,C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall R.C=\\operatorname{forall}(R,C),\\quad\\exists R.C=\\operatorname{exists}(R,C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}\\)</span> 作用于任意 ALC 概念。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-概念表达式\">2. 概念表达式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\)</span> 为满足下列条款的最小集合。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\">\\(\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in N_C\">\\(A\\in N_C\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\">\\(\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(C)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(C)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\">\\(C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conj}(C,D)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\">\\(\\operatorname{conj}(C,D)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\">\\(C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{disj}(C,D)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\">\\(\\operatorname{disj}(C,D)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{forall}(R,C)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\">\\(\\operatorname{forall}(R,C)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{exists}(R,C)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\">\\(\\operatorname{exists}(R,C)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-包含式与-TBox\">3. 包含式与 TBox</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\n=\n\\{(C,D):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\n=\n\\{(C,D):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>TBox 载体为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TBox}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\n=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TBox}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\n=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-自由名字与替换\">4. 自由名字与替换</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\to\\mathcal P(N_C\\cup N_R)\">\\(\\operatorname{FN}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\to\\mathcal P(N_C\\cup N_R)\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\{A\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\{A\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\neg C)=\\operatorname{FN}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\neg C)=\\operatorname{FN}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\forall R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\forall R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\exists R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\exists R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义无绑定名字函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}(C)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}(C)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个名字排序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\{N_C,N_R\\}\">\\(S\\in\\{N_C,N_R\\}\\)</span> 固定无重复枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^S_0,e^S_1,\\ldots\">\\(e^S_0,e^S_1,\\ldots\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq S\">\\(X\\subseteq S\\)</span> 有限，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}(S,X)=e^S_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{k:e^S_k\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}(S,X)=e^S_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{k:e^S_k\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_C:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\">\\(\\theta_C:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_R:N_R\\to N_R\">\\(\\theta_R:N_R\\to N_R\\)</span>，定义替换</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\top)=\\top,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\top)=\\top,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\theta_C(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\theta_C(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\neg C)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\neg C)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcap\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcap\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcup\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcup\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\forall R.C)=\\forall\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\forall R.C)=\\forall\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\exists R.C)=\\exists\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\exists R.C)=\\exists\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R}\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALC}}\n=\n\\{(C,C):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALC}}\n=\n\\{(C,C):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall R.C\">\\(\\forall R.C\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists R.C\">\\(\\exists R.C\\)</span> 是角色限制构造子，不绑定概念名或角色名；捕获避免重命名就是保持排序的有限支撑替换，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\)</span> 只用于选择未出现在有限名字集中的新名字。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{lat}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{lat}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)=\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)=\\mathcal T\\)</span>，且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{lat}}\n=\n\\{C\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{C\\sqsubseteq\\top:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\bot\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{lat}}\n=\n\\{C\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{C\\sqsubseteq\\top:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\bot\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{C\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{D\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{C\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{D\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>完整否定公理族为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg}\n=\n\\{C\\sqcap\\neg C\\sqsubseteq\\bot:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\top\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup\\neg C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg}\n=\n\\{C\\sqcap\\neg C\\sqsubseteq\\bot:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\top\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup\\neg C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{C\\sqsubseteq\\neg\\neg C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\neg\\neg C\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{C\\sqsubseteq\\neg\\neg C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\neg\\neg C\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n=\\{(((C,D),(D,E)),(C,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n=\\{(((C,D),(D,E)),(C,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n=\\{(((C,D),(C,E)),(C,D\\sqcap E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n=\\{(((C,D),(C,E)),(C,D\\sqcap E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\n=\\{(((C,E),(D,E)),(C\\sqcup D,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\n=\\{(((C,E),(D,E)),(C\\sqcup D,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\forall R.C,\\forall R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\forall R.C,\\forall R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\exists R.C,\\exists R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\exists R.C,\\exists R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n=\\{(((C,\\bot)),(C,D)):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n=\\{(((C,\\bot)),(C,D)):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 出发的 ALC 证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\)</span>，并且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 的下列七个许可条件至少一个成立（析取）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}(\\mathcal T)\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}(\\mathcal T)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义证明谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 是上述有型非空有限序列、每行满足七类许可的析取且末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,D)\">\\((C,D)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可导出关系\">8. 可导出关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALC}}C\\sqsubseteq D\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALC}}C\\sqsubseteq D\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\\{I\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}:\\mathcal T\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALC}}I\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\\{I\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}:\\mathcal T\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALC}}I\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-语义结构与解释\">9. 语义结构与解释</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\)</span> 是所有集合结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I=(\\Delta,\\iota_C,\\iota_R)\">\\(\\mathcal I=(\\Delta,\\iota_C,\\iota_R)\\)</span> 的类谓词，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\iota_C:N_C\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta),\\quad\n\\iota_R:N_R\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\iota_C:N_C\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta),\\quad\n\\iota_R:N_R\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALC}}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\">\\(⟦-⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALC}}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\top⟧=\\Delta,\\quad\n⟦\\bot⟧=\\varnothing,\\quad\n⟦ A⟧=\\iota_C(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\top⟧=\\Delta,\\quad\n⟦\\bot⟧=\\varnothing,\\quad\n⟦ A⟧=\\iota_C(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\neg C⟧=\\Delta\\setminus⟦ C⟧,\\quad\n⟦ C\\sqcap D⟧=⟦ C⟧\\cap⟦ D⟧,\\quad\n⟦ C\\sqcup D⟧=⟦ C⟧\\cup⟦ D⟧,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\neg C⟧=\\Delta\\setminus⟦ C⟧,\\quad\n⟦ C\\sqcap D⟧=⟦ C⟧\\cap⟦ D⟧,\\quad\n⟦ C\\sqcup D⟧=⟦ C⟧\\cup⟦ D⟧,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\forall R.C⟧=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta:\\forall y\\in\\Delta\\ ((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\Rightarrow y\\in⟦ C⟧)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\forall R.C⟧=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta:\\forall y\\in\\Delta\\ ((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\Rightarrow y\\in⟦ C⟧)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\exists R.C⟧=\n\\{x:\\exists y((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\land y\\in⟦ C⟧)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\exists R.C⟧=\n\\{x:\\exists y((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\land y\\in⟦ C⟧)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-满足关系与语义后承\">10. 满足关系与语义后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALC}}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ C⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\subseteq\n⟦ D⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALC}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALC}}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ C⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\subseteq\n⟦ D⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALC}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALC}}I\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal K=(\\mathcal T,\\varnothing,\\varnothing)\\land I\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\n((\\forall J\\in\\mathcal T\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALC}}J)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALC}}I).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALC}}I\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal K=(\\mathcal T,\\varnothing,\\varnothing)\\land I\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\n((\\forall J\\in\\mathcal T\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALC}}J)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALC}}I).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-特征差异\">11. 特征差异</h1>\n<p>ALC 的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{disj},\\operatorname{exists}\\},\n\\{\\operatorname{atLeast},\\operatorname{atMost},\\operatorname{roleHierarchy},\\operatorname{inv},\\operatorname{nom}\\}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{disj},\\operatorname{exists}\\},\n\\{\\operatorname{atLeast},\\operatorname{atMost},\\operatorname{roleHierarchy},\\operatorname{inv},\\operatorname{nom}\\}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第一分量要求任意概念否定、析取和完整存在限制都作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\)</span>；因此 ALC 不退化为 AL 或 ALE。</p>\n<h1 id=\"12.-整个形式系统\">12. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>下列元组是元语言中的规格列表；含类谓词的分量不表示把所有集合结构收集为一个集合。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\n=\n(N_C,N_R,\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\n\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALC}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},⟦-⟧^{\\mathsf{ALC}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALC}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\n=\n(N_C,N_R,\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\n\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALC}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},⟦-⟧^{\\mathsf{ALC}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALC}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义 ALC 句法包含演算和本地语义；不包含角色层级、逆角色、名词、数目限制或外部有效性集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"718-ALC","text":"718 ALC","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-概念表达式","text":"2. 概念表达式","level":1},{"id":"3.-包含式与-TBox","text":"3. 包含式与 TBox","level":1},{"id":"4.-自由名字与替换","text":"4. 自由名字与替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则","text":"6. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导出关系","text":"8. 可导出关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-语义结构与解释","text":"9. 语义结构与解释","level":1},{"id":"10.-满足关系与语义后承","text":"10. 满足关系与语义后承","level":1},{"id":"11.-特征差异","text":"11. 特征差异","level":1},{"id":"12.-整个形式系统","text":"12. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)","display":false},{"tex":"N_C","display":false},{"tex":"N_R","display":false},{"tex":"N_C\\cap N_R=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{name}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}:\nN_R\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALC}}.","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{name}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\top=\\operatorname{top},\\quad\\bot=\\operatorname{bottom},\\quad\\neg C=\\operatorname{neg}(C),","display":true},{"tex":"C\\sqcap D=\\operatorname{conj}(C,D),\\quad C\\sqcup D=\\operatorname{disj}(C,D),","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall R.C=